n                    }\n                    break;\n                }\n\n                state[pos] = -1;\n                runningTotal -= 3 * basePowers.get(pos);\n                pos++;\n\n                if (pos == size) break mainLoop;\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(solutionFound ? \"YES\" : \"NO\");\n    }\n\n    static class FastScanner {\n        BufferedReader reader;\n        StringTokenizer tokenizer;\n\n        FastScanner() {\n            reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n            tokenizer = new StringTokenizer(\"\");\n        }\n\n        String next() {\n            try {\n                while (!tokenizer.hasMoreTokens()) {\n                    tokenizer = new StringTokenizer(reader.readLine());\n                }\n            } catch (IOException e) {\n                e.printStackTrace();\n            }\n            return tokenizer.nextToken();\n        }\n\n        int nextInt() {\n            return Integer.parseInt(next());\n        }\n\n        long nextLong() {\n            return Long.parseLong(next());\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass FastScanner {\npublic:\n    BufferedReader reader;\n    vector<string> tokens;\n    int tokenIndex;\n\n    FastScanner() : tokenIndex(0) {\n        reader = BufferedReader(cin.rdbuf());\n    }\n\n    string next() {\n        while (tokenIndex >= tokens.size()) {\n            string line;\n            if (!getline(reader, line)) {\n                return \"\";\n            }\n            istringstream iss(line);\n            tokens.clear();\n            tokenIndex = 0;\n            string token;\n            while (iss >> token) {\n                tokens.push_back(token);\n            }\n        }\n        return tokens[tokenIndex++];\n    }\n\n    int nextInt() {\n        return stoi(next());\n    }\n\n    long long nextLong() {\n        return stoll(next());\n    }\n};\n\nint main() {\n    FastScanner fs;\n    long long w = fs.nextLong(), m = fs.nextLong();\n\n    if (w <= 3) {\n        cout << \"YES\" << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    vector<long long> basePowers;\n    long long power = 1;\n    while (power <= 2000000000LL) {\n        basePowers.push_back(power);\n        if (power > 2000000000LL / w) break;\n        power *= w;\n    }\n\n    int size = basePowers.size();\n    vector<int> state(size, -1);\n\n    long long runningTotal = 0;\n    for (long long b : basePowers) runningTotal -= b;\n\n    bool solutionFound = false;\n\n    while (true) {\n        int pos = 0;\n        while (true) {\n            state[pos]++;\n            runningTotal += basePowers[pos];\n\n            if (state[pos] != 2) {\n                if (abs(runningTotal) == m) {\n                    solutionFound = true;\n                    break;\n                }\n                break;\n            }\n\n            state[pos] = -1;\n            runningTotal -= 3 * basePowers[pos];\n            pos++;\n\n            if (pos == size) break;\n        }\n\n        if (pos == size) break;\n        if (solutionFound) break;\n    }\n\n    cout << (solutionFound ? \"YES\" : \"NO\") << endl;\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00013410145766101778, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00046790618216618896, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -4.768360213347478e-06, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -8.583032467868179e-06, -2.264974000354414e-06, -0.0018079616129398346, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.8577666282653809, -9.703165414975956e-05, -2.3007127310847864e-05, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -0.20982028543949127, -1.9073468